{
  "slug": "parenting-frameworks",
  "name": "Parenting Frameworks",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Parenting & Education Framework Guide — 16 frameworks: Positive Discipline (Adler), PET (Gordon), CPS (Greene), Emotion Coaching (Gottman), Triple P, Attachment Parenting (Bowlby/Ainsworth/Siegel), SDT Parenting (Deci/Ryan), Retrieval Practice, Growth Mindset (Dweck), UbD (Wiggins/McTighe), PBL, Montessori, DAP (NAEYC), UDL, Formative Assessment (Black/Wiliam), Differentiated Instruction (Tomlinson). Korean parenting/education context. Invoke /parenting.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **17 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (17): `attachment-parenting` (Attachment-Based Parenting (Bowlby, Ainsworth, Siegel) — Build secure attachment through sensitive responsiveness, the 4 S's, repair conversations, and…), `cps` (Collaborative & Proactive Solutions (Ross Greene) — 'Kids do well if they can.' Solve problems WITH children, not…), `dap` (Developmentally Appropriate Practice (NAEYC) — a framework for early childhood education that promotes optimal learning and development by…), `differentiated-instruction` (Differentiated Instruction (Carol Ann Tomlinson) — a proactive approach to teaching that adjusts content, process, product, and learning…), `emotion-coaching` (Emotion Coaching (John Gottman) — Raise emotionally intelligent children through 5 steps: awareness, connection, empathic listening, naming emotions,…), `formative-assessment` (Formative Assessment (Black & Wiliam) — assessment FOR learning, not just OF learning), `growth-mindset` (Growth Mindset (Carol Dweck) — the belief that abilities can be developed through dedication and hard work), `montessori` (Montessori Method (Maria Montessori) — child-led education through prepared environments, sensory materials, mixed-age grouping, and respect for natural…), and 9 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install parenting-frameworks@claude-community` from `ironyjk/parenting-frameworks`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
